    Bug 2017764 - Create a fragment for AutoTreeView rows and only update what changes. r=freaktechnik

    Every row in a tree view is going to have the same DOM, so we can create it once and clone it.
    This is much faster than creating all of the elements every time a row needs updating. We do have
    to take care that when we recycle rows we clear out the previous state.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D283995

